      "writtenOn": "2018-08-30T18:29:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With this change all NPCX boards should move to 32K or 64K block erase. I did not put in an error for 4K intentionally because the erase size is anyways driven based on the RO/RW size. If the ECs have a size which cannot be aligned or cannot be big enough, they don\u0027t have an option but to fall back to sector erase.",
      "parentUuid": "e1ae8e37_be22d116",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 81,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 6
