      "writtenOn": "2018-08-31T01:48:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Npcx ec reserves the flexibility which can adjust the size of data and code ram freely. Please refer https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/factory-gru-9017.B/board/kevin/board.h#37. In this case, we move 8k ram from data to code ram since firmware size is not enough. I also think putting in an error for 4K alignment might be unnecessary.",
      "parentUuid": "434a6d6a_6a98f071",
