      "writtenOn": "2018-08-31T10:00:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SIZE\tis also used in chip/npcx/spiflashfw/npcx_monitor.c.\n(https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/chip/npcx/spiflashfw/npcx_monitor.c#199)\nChange the CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SIZE to 32/64 KB may cause problem here because line 206 still uses SECTOR_ERASE command.\nI suggest to fix the problem by the following patch:\ndiff --git a/chip/npcx/config_flash_layout.h b/chip/npcx/config_flash_layout.h\nindex 532f7debc..8161cf176 100644\n--- a/chip/npcx/config_flash_layout.h\n+++ b/chip/npcx/config_flash_layout.h\n@@ -100,6 +100,7 @@\n #define NPCX_ERASE_COMMAND\t\tCMD_SECTOR_ERASE\n #endif\n \n+#define CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SECTOR_SIZE 0x1000\n #define CONFIG_FLASH_BANK_SIZE\t\tCONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SIZE\n #define CONFIG_FLASH_WRITE_SIZE\t\t0x1  /* minimum write size */\n #define CONFIG_FLASH_WRITE_IDEAL_SIZE\t256   /* one page size for write */\ndiff --git a/chip/npcx/spiflashfw/npcx_monitor.c b/chip/npcx/spiflashfw/npcx_monitor.c\nindex ed2d2bbd5..aa531be8f 100644\n--- a/chip/npcx/spiflashfw/npcx_monitor.c\n+++ b/chip/npcx/spiflashfw/npcx_monitor.c\n@@ -196,8 +196,8 @@ void sspi_flash_physical_erase(int offset, int size)\n \tsspi_flash_tristate(0);\n \n \t/* Alignment has been checked in upper layer */\n-\tfor (; size \u003e 0; size -\u003d CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SIZE,\n-\t\toffset +\u003d CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SIZE) {\n+\tfor (; size \u003e 0; size -\u003d CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SECTOR_SIZE,\n+\t\toffset +\u003d CONFIG_FLASH_ERASE_SECTOR_SIZE) {\n \t\t/* Enable write */\n \t\tsspi_flash_write_enable();\n \t\t/* Set erase address */",
